Dear Torchlight Hunters,

The City of Aeterna Season will open on September 7th (PDT) . Hunters can watch the Season Preview Livestream Replay to quickly learn about the new season's updates:

 Season-exclusive Gameplay: Including new gameplay, new boss, and new Soul Candle system;
 New Hero and Hero Trait: The Forsaken Iris, who can quickly grow Spirit Magus, and the extreme Frostfire Flame of Pleasure;
 New Skills and Legendary Gear: New skills adapted to the Spirit Magus system, as well as several new Legendary Gears;
 Important Adjustments: Crafting system optimizations, old Hero Trait enhancements, Legendary Gear Blueprint construction, Netherrealm gameplay optimizations, and more;
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Quk1O9BQY-8

